HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0339.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0340.fits,spectra0341.fits, spectra0342.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0343.fits,spectra0344.fits, spectra0345.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0346.fits,spectra0347.fits, spectra0348.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0349.fits,spectra0350.fits, spectra0351.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0352.fits,spectra0353.fits, spectra0354.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0355.fits,spectra0356.fits, spectra0357.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0358.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 1.0393563710155818, 1.019383625070224,0.948135771865203,                HISTORY 1.0280858180109862, 0.9762544369129902,1.0628731593716274,              HISTORY 0.9655918234468839, 1.0013688492781792,1.1087710353981024,              HISTORY 0.9530496200251273, 0.9160026497130912,0.9986348879870082,              HISTORY 1.0314582641284398, 1.0113745626384403,0.9431631111641477,              HISTORY 0.9763351546891089, 0.9818347711388351,1.1077643140896785,              HISTORY 0.9872018563913679, 1.1437978196872893.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             